  "notes": "{反対|はんたい}する means to oppose or object to something.\n\nPATTERN:\n〜に{反対|はんたい}する: to oppose/object to ~\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {反対|はんたい}{意見|いけん}: opposing opinion\n- {反対票|はんたいひょう}: vote against\n- {反対運動|はんたいうんどう}: opposition movement\n- {反対派|はんたいは}: opposition faction\n- {反対|はんたい}{側|がわ}: opposite side; opposition\n\nNOUN USE:\n{反対|はんたい} alone can mean \"opposite\" or \"opposition\":\n- {反対|はんたい}の{方向|ほうこう}: opposite direction\n- {賛成|さんせい}か{反対|はんたい}か: for or against\n\nCONTRAST:\n- {反対|はんたい}する: to oppose (disagree with)\n- {賛成|さんせい}する: to agree with, support",
